OL,3,GNEWSARepair work to start on busy
OL,4,Amotorway interchange
OL,5,
OL,6,FMajor work is due to begin on a busy
OL,7,Fmotorway interchange.
OL,9,FTemporary lane closures and traffic
OL,10,Flights on entry and exit slip roads at
OL,11,Fjunction 14 of the Almondsbury
OL,12,FInterchange on the M5 near Bristol will
OL,13,Fbe in force overnight between 21:00 BST
OL,14,Fand 06:00 until 17 September.
OL,16,FThe closures mark the start of several
OL,17,Fmonths of work at the interchange where
OL,18,Fthe M4 and M5 meet.
OL,20,FNational Highways said permanent
OL,21,Frepairs were needed after temporary
OL,22,Ffixes were made in 2024.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
